OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy and windy in the morning
OL,6,Fwith rain turning heavy at times. Wind
OL,7,Feasing through the afternoon with
OL,8,Fdrier and brighter spells spreading to
OL,9,Fall parts from the southwest.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly dry at first with
OL,12,Fvariable cloud and some clear spells,
OL,13,Fbut showers still in the northeast.
OL,14,FFurther cloud and outbreaks of rain
OL,15,Fspread northeast overnight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FIt will be cloudy through
OL,18,Fthe day with further outbreaks of
OL,19,Frain, particularly in the morning with
OL,20,Fsome drier spells developing later in
OL,21,Fthe day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
